@startuml forms-journey-death
title Sample journey - death, autopsy and forensic branches (volumes 1, 9, 10)
autonumber

actor Deceased as D
participant "Hospital / registry\n(vol 1)" as H
participant "Pathology dept\n(vol 9)" as PA
participant "Forensic bureau\n(vol 10)" as FB

D -> H : death occurs
H -> H : 106 death certificate registration\n(106-2 if perinatal)

alt natural death, clinical autopsy
  H -> PA : body referred for autopsy
  PA -> PA : 223 register of autopsied bodies\n224 autopsy protocol
  PA -> PA : 225 referral for histology\n226 sectional / 227 biopsy material
else violent / unexplained death
  H -> FB : body referred to forensic bureau
  FB -> FB : 233 thanatology registration\n229 forensic examination report\n230 expert conclusion
  FB -> FB : 231 referral to forensic lab\n232 forensic histology, 241 chemistry
end

note over PA, FB
  Both branches end in a laboratory step
  (histology, chemistry). Tissue and toxicology
  results map to DiagnosticReport + Observation,
  the same pattern as clinical labs in volume 3.
end note
@enduml
